The harness (harness/harness.jar and harness/src/Harness.java) contains only
the tiny Harness class. At runtime it resolves the Nexus Personal classes from
the app already installed on the user's own device and delegates the DSKPP
exchange to them. The files under harness/stubs/ are minimal compile-time API
declarations; they contain no implementation.

